---
import ProseLayout from '@/layouts/ProseLayout.astro';
---

<ProseLayout
  eyebrow="Newsletter"
  title="Not live yet"
  description="The Runtime Signals newsletter is not live yet."
  canonicalPath="/newsletter"
  noindex={true}
>
  <aside class="newsletter-status" aria-label="Newsletter status">
    <span class="newsletter-status__label eyebrow">Status</span>
    <p>Provider verification is still in progress. No subscriber data is collected here.</p>
  </aside>
  <p>
    There's no signup form on this page. The newsletter architecture is decided - a managed provider
    stays authoritative for subscriber state, this site never stores an email address, and no
    webhook endpoint exists until there's a durable store that actually needs one - but the provider
    itself hasn't been verified at the account level yet, and no production email will send until
    DNS authentication and consent handling are confirmed.
  </p>
  <p>
    Check back once that verification is complete. Until then, follow the publication with <a
      href="/rss.xml">RSS</a
    > or <a href="/atom.xml">Atom</a>.
  </p>
</ProseLayout>

<style>
  .newsletter-status {
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--signal);
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-5);
  }

  .newsletter-status__label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
  }

  .newsletter-status p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }
</style>
